Oscar says, The Office, an American workplace, airing on PBS next month, is a documentary following the employees of Scranton's own Dunder Mifflin Paper Company.
奥斯卡说：‘《办公室》，一部美国职场纪录片，将于下个月在公共电视网（PBS）播出，记录了斯克兰顿当地邓德·米夫林造纸公司员工的生活。’

